// Article 3. Missed time.
#require "2-holidays.charter".
Duty make-up-due Holder parent Claimant other
  Due within 60 days
  Terminated by give-make-up-time
Act give-make-up-time Actor parent Recipient other
Extend Act hand-over
  Creates make-up-due(parent, other)
    When Violated(regular-week(parent, other)) || Violated(holiday-time(parent, other))

Clause 3.1/1 => hand-over, make-up-due
Clause 3.1/2 => make-up-due, give-make-up-time.
